; Deck 2 - the Cargo Holds.
;
; Deeper in, the mob is organised: Nobz, looted heavy weapons, and the first
; of the Chaos Androids. The Orks did not build those. They found them in the
; holds, crated and labelled, and something woke them up.

Wandering-Monsters
(   1D12
    1-1     "4 Gretchin (20 Points)"
    2-3     "3 Orks (30 Points)"
    4-4     "2 Chaos Androids (30 Points)"
    5-6     "2 Orks, 1 Ork with Heavy Bolter (35 Points)"
    7-7     "1 Chaos Android, 2 Orks (35 Points)"
    8-8     "4 Orks (40 Points)"
    9-9     "1 Ork Nob, 2 Orks (40 Points)"
   10-10    "3 Chaos Androids (45 Points)"
   11-11    "2 Orks, 2 Chaos Androids (50 Points)"
   12-12    "1 Ork Nob, 1 Ork with Missile Launcher, 2 Gretchin (60 Points)"
)

Lairs-Matrix
(   1D12
    1-1     "4 Orks, 4 Gretchin (60 Points)"
    2-2     "4 Chaos Androids (60 Points)"
    3-3     "3 Orks, 2 Ork Heavy Weapons (65 Points)"
    4-4     "3 Chaos Androids, 2 Orks (65 Points)"
    5-5     "6 Orks (60 Points)"
    6-6     "2 Chaos Androids, 4 Gretchin, 2 Orks (70 Points)"
    7-7     "5 Orks, 1 Ork with Heavy Bolter (80 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
    8-8     "4 Chaos Androids, 2 Orks (90 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
    9-9     "4 Orks, 2 Chaos Androids, 4 Gretchin (100 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
   10-10    "3 Orks, 2 Ork Heavy Weapons, 3 Chaos Androids (110 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
   11-11    "6 Orks, 4 Chaos Androids (120 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
   12-12    "5 Chaos Androids, 4 Orks, 4 Gretchin (140 Points)" & Specialist-Xenos()
)

